{
  "id": "draft-and-publish",
  "title": "Draft & Publish",
  "width": 1536,
  "height": 960,
  "bytes": {
    "light": 1025258,
    "dark": 997168
  },
  "intro": {
    "text": "Welcome to the guided tour of the Draft & Publish feature!",
    "button": "Let's go 🚀",
    "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/01"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/01",
      "text": "Draft & Publish is the feature that allows you to manage content-types as drafts before publishing them.\n\nBefore using it, it should be enabled via the **Content-type Builder**.",
      "rect": {
        "x": 79.75,
        "y": 3.96,
        "w": 6.06,
        "h": 4.58
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/02",
      "text": "Let's go to the **advanced settings** of the content-type of our choice!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 64.94,
        "y": 29.29,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 4.9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/03",
      "text": "Draft & Publish is by default enabled for all content-types.",
      "rect": {
        "x": 24.67,
        "y": 51.04,
        "w": 25.07,
        "h": 5.41
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/03",
      "text": "Now that we know Draft & Publish is enabled for our articles, we can move to the **Content Manager** to use it!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 73.63,
        "y": 34.9,
        "w": 2.08,
        "h": 3.33
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/04",
      "text": "In the **list view of the Content Manager**, with Draft & Publish enabled, you can see a \"Status\" column indicating which articles are a draft and which are published.",
      "rect": {
        "x": 84.72,
        "y": 22.4,
        "w": 6.28,
        "h": 40.89
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/04",
      "text": "Let's publish an article!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 28.68,
        "y": 49.17,
        "w": 19.87,
        "h": 6.77
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/05",
      "text": "At the top of the interface, below the title, you can see the **status of the article**.",
      "rect": {
        "x": 22.01,
        "y": 10.21,
        "w": 4.2,
        "h": 4.38
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/06",
      "text": "And here you can see **2 tabs**:\n• **Draft** is where you can edit your article.\n• **Published** is a read-only tab where you can see the content that is published. It is only accessible if the article is published.",
      "rect": {
        "x": 22.01,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 11.55,
        "h": 6.15
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/06",
      "text": "Let's click on the *Publish* button to visit the Published tab!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 79.75,
        "y": 29.37,
        "w": 12.89,
        "h": 3.33
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/07",
      "text": "Now that we have published the article, the status is updated to \"Published\" and the Published tab is accessible!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 22.01,
        "y": 10.21,
        "w": 11.55,
        "h": 10.94
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/07",
      "text": "Click the **Published tab**!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 26.92,
        "y": 15.63,
        "w": 6.25,
        "h": 4.9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/08",
      "text": "The content of the article, as it was published, is shown here in read-only mode."
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/08",
      "text": "Let's go back to the **Draft tab**!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 22.4,
        "y": 15.63,
        "w": 4.52,
        "h": 4.9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/09",
      "text": "Via the *...* button, you can **unpublish the article**.",
      "rect": {
        "x": 80.27,
        "y": 37.4,
        "w": 14.65,
        "h": 3.75
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/06",
      "text": "Draft & Publish supports **bulk actions**, meaning that changing the status can be done for several entries of the same content-type, simultaneously."
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/06",
      "text": "Let's go back to the **list view of the Content Manager**!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 22.4,
        "y": 2.5,
        "w": 3.63,
        "h": 2.08
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/10",
      "text": "Let's select a couple of articles from the table!"
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/11",
      "text": "Tick the boxes to select your articles!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 24.28,
        "y": 63.28,
        "w": 1.3,
        "h": 2.08
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/12",
      "text": "You can see buttons above the table. These are the available actions that can be performed simultaneously for the selected entries.",
      "rect": {
        "x": 22.01,
        "y": 22.29,
        "w": 19.09,
        "h": 4.58
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/12",
      "text": "Let's publish the 2 articles!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 30.43,
        "y": 22.92,
        "w": 5.06,
        "h": 3.33
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/13",
      "text": "A dialog will indicate you if the entries can be published or if a pending action is preventing the publishing.",
      "rect": {
        "x": 22.59,
        "y": 21.43,
        "w": 54.82,
        "h": 57.14
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/14",
      "text": "Since both articles are **ready to publish**, we can go ahead and click the *Publish* button!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 70.66,
        "y": 72.94,
        "w": 5.06,
        "h": 3.33
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/14",
      "text": "Click *Publish* again to confirm the action.",
      "rect": {
        "x": 70.62,
        "y": 72.9,
        "w": 5.05,
        "h": 3.33
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/15",
      "text": "We can see in the Status column that our 2 articles have properly been published!",
      "rect": {
        "x": 84.72,
        "y": 22.4,
        "w": 8.39,
        "h": 40.89
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/16",
      "text": "✏️ Note that you can also bulk unpublish entries of your content-type."
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "image": "/img/assets/interactive-demos/draft-and-publish/15",
      "text": "And that's it! We've used Draft & Publish to manage drafts and publish (or unpublish) one or more entries ✨"
    }
  ],
  "outro": {
    "text": "Thank you for following this guided tour!",
